# Only actual image inputs. Host adapters, state, credentials and docs excluded.
# The opencode dir exception exists for traversal only; the COPY inputs are the
# two explicit file rules below (a file under an excluded parent dir cannot be
# re-included, so the parent exception must stay).
**
!Dockerfile
!harnesses/
!harnesses/opencode/
!harnesses/opencode/entrypoint.sh
!harnesses/opencode/archive.py
!harnesses/opencode/auth.sh
!harnesses/opencode/auth-state.py
!harnesses/opencode/auth-volume.py
!harnesses/muse/
!harnesses/muse/auth.sh
!harnesses/codex/
!harnesses/codex/auth.sh
!harnesses/codex/policy/
!harnesses/codex/policy/requirements.toml
# Shared auth supervisor and process shutdown helper (host and
# entrypoint share one supervised install/collect/commit/scrub/idle contract).
# The lib dir exception exists for traversal only, exactly like harnesses/.
!lib/
!lib/supervisor.sh
!lib/supervisor-process.py
